  "rationale": "The notes capture a vast amount of detail but suffer from severe repetition and several critical contradictions. The model failed to resolve superseded values, resulting in conflicting statements (e.g., stating the rollout is 5% but assigning an action item for 10%; stating Maya owns the runbook but assigning it to Viktor). It also introduced numeric and timeline errors, such as claiming only one shard was dry-run (after correctly stating three) and shifting the Kestrel Logistics remediation dates from September to October. Speaker attribution is inconsistent, mixing names with raw speaker labels. The inclusion of distractors and extreme redundancy significantly degrade conciseness and readability."
